						<font fontName="SansSerif" size="10"/>
						<paragraph lineSpacing="1_1_2"/>
					</textElement>
					<textFieldExpression><![CDATA["Utility service has been disconnected at the above address for non-payment of the past due charges on the utility account. Before the service will be reconnected, you must contact our office either <b>in person or by phone</b> and pay the total noted above which includes the past due balance, a reconnect fee, and possibly a utility deposit. <br /><br />"+

"Reconnection is not guaranteed to be on the same day that the payment is received, but if it’s received <b>before 3:00 p.m.</b> we will do our best to reconnect that day. <br /><br />"+

"Thank you, <br /><br />"]]></textFieldExpression>
